  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/800/847/minecraft_title-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1023\" height=\"348\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>模组简介</strong></p><p>每5分钟随机将所有玩家传送到新位置</p><p><em>支持服务端安装。只需在服务器安装此模组，客户端无需安装。</em></p><p>由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>原班人马打造</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>特色功能</h2><p>（以下特性将大幅提升你的原版游戏体验）&nbsp;</p><p>本模组会每5分钟将游戏中所有玩家随机传送到新坐标。渴望新鲜挑战？立即获取这款模组！</p><p>每次随机传送后将获得缓降和抗性提升效果</p><p>在下界和末地维度同样生效</p><p>建议搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero世界地图</a>或<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" rel=\"nofollow\">旅行地图</a>类模组使用</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>传送触发时的游戏截图：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/800/848/2024-02-01_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Xaero世界地图显示的传送坐标记录：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/800/849/2024-02-01_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即搭建服务器与好友同乐！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，使用优惠码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享25折！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
